    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Carroll are excited to present this homespun detached bungalow, with adjoining workshop & yard, to the market, occupying a pleasant rural setting convenient to Dromiskin Village. \n\nSet on approximately 0.16 hectares / 0.42 acres, the property offers an exciting opportunity for those seeking a traditional country residence with generous outdoor space and a range of useful outbuildings suitable for home enterprise, a workshop or storage compound (subject to the relevant planning permissions).\n\nThe property retains much of its original character and extends to 80 sq.m. / 860 sq.ft. approx. providing for an entrance porch, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms, utility room, guest w.c. and a shower room. Externally, the property is complimented by gardens to the front, side and rear with the driveway providing convenient off-street parking. A particularly attractive feature of the property is the enclosed yard and outbuildings extending to 863sq ft situated adjacent the house providing excellent additional space and flexibility for a wide range of uses. \n\nThe property is ideally positioned for those seeking a rural lifestyle while still being within easy reach of everyday amenities. Dromiskin Village is approximately 1.9km away and provides a range of local services including a petrol station, church, credit union and primary school. Dundalk Town is approximately 10.5km away, while Ardee is approximately 12.5km both offering a wide range of additional services and amenities. In addition, M1 Motorway Junction 15 is within easy reach - suitable for those commuting or operating on a hybrid working basis in both Dublin & Belfast. \n\nOverall, this is an appealing property, particularly for those looking to develop a modern residence in a charming countryside setting, all on a manageable 0.42-acre site. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to see and experience all this home has to offer."
      },
